:: Eden Transformation
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _wolfBiteChoice to false>>

<<switch $eden_tf_choice>>
<<case "cow">>
	You step up to Eden and gently headbutt <<him>> with your horns.
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> pauses, then pats your head.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<br><br>
		You moo, content, and <<he>> almost smiles.
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> takes you by the horns and scratches behind your ears, like you're <<his>> to handle.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
		<br><br>
		You moo, happy to be held this way.
	<<else>>
		<<He>> rubs a calloused thumb along the base of your horns.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
		<br><br>
		You moo, content, and <<he>> almost smiles.
	<</if>>

<<case "bird">>
	<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6>>
		You sing for Eden. <span class="green">Your voice is immaculate.</span> <<He>> stops what <<hes>> doing to listen.
		Something in <<his>> face softens, as if the song stirs an old memory.<<stress -2>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
		<br><br>
		<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
			When you finish, <<he>> draws you against <<his>> chest. "...That was good," <<he>> manages, the words coming out stiff.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
			<<He>> hooks an arm around you and holds you close, like something <<he>> means to keep. "...Again," <<he>> says.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> pulls you into <<his>> arms. "...Beautiful," <<he>> says, quiet, then looks away as if the word slipped out on its own.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 4>>
		You sing for Eden. <span class="blue">Your voice is lovely.</span> <<He>> listens, and the tension eases from <<his>> shoulders.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
		<br><br>
		<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
			A faint smile tugs at <<his>> mouth. <<He>> strokes your hair.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
			A faint smile tugs at <<his>> mouth. <<He>> strokes your cheek, slow, like you're <<his>> to soothe.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<else>>
			A faint smile tugs at <<his>> mouth. <<He>> brushes your cheek with the backs of <<his>> fingers.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<</if>>
		<<He>> likes your singing. You can tell.
	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 2>>
		You sing for Eden. <span class="red">Your voice cracks and grates.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<He>> frowns, but says nothing. Once <<he>>'s sure you aren't crying out in distress, <<he>> rubs your back and returns to <<his>> work.
	<</if>>

<<case "fox">>
	You lean in and brush your tail across <<his>> face. <<He>> sneezes, the tip of <<his>> nose going red.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> huffs, amused, and strokes your tail.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> huffs, amused, and scratches the base of your tail until you squirm.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<arousal 200>><<glove>><<garousal>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> huffs, amused, runs a hand down your tail, then cups your face.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>

<<case "cat">>
	You crawl into Eden's lap and drape yourself across <<his>> thighs, purring. <<He>> goes still, caught off guard, then <<his>> gaze warms.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> cups your face in <<his>> calloused hands.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> scratches around your ears with <<his>> calloused fingers, like you're <<his>> to keep.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> scratches under your chin with <<his>> calloused fingers.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>
	You hold <<his>> gaze and slow-blink. <<He>> seems quietly pleased to have been chosen.

<<case "bunny">>
	You press your twitching nose to Eden's jaw and nuzzle in close.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> stills so as not to startle you, and smooths your ears back with one hand.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> gathers you into <<his>> lap and folds your ears down under <<his>> palm, keeping you there.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> scratches the base of your ears until your foot thumps against the floor.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>

<<case "bear">>
	You lean your full weight into Eden and rub your cheek against <<his>> shoulder, nearly knocking <<him>> off balance.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> braces, steadies you, and huffs out something close to a laugh.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> plants a hand at the back of your neck and holds you against <<him>>, unmoved.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> ruffles your hair and scratches behind your ears.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>

<<case "waterdragon">>
	You wind close and drape yourself along Eden's side, your cool skin against <<his>> warmth, and let out a low trilling croon.
	<br><br>
	<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
		<<He>> runs a curious thumb over the skin at your wrist.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
		<<He>> takes you by the base of your head and keeps you coiled against <<him>>.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> traces the ridge of skin down your arm, unhurried.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
	<</if>>

<<case "wolf">>
	<<if random(1, 100) lte 35>>
		<<set _wolfBiteChoice to true>>
		You move in close and set your teeth against Eden's neck, gentle, no real force behind it. <<He>> goes rigid, then just stares at you.
		"...What are you doing?"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Explain it's affection|Eden Bite Tell]]>><<npcincr Eden love 2>><</link>><<glove>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Say nothing and pull away|Eden Bite Silent]]>><<npcincr Eden dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
	<<else>>
		You press in close, biting and licking softly at <<his>> neck. <<He>> glances down at you, and you feel <<his>> pulse pick up.<<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glust>>
		<br><br>
		<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
			<<His>> rough palm settles on your back.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
			<<He>> takes your chin and scratches under it, like you're <<his>> pet.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<glove>>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> scratches behind your ears, and you lean into it.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<arousal 200>><<glove>><<garousal>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<if not _wolfBiteChoice>>
	<<link [[Back|Cabin Eden Actions]]>><<unset $eden_tf_choice>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Eden Bite Tell
<<effects>><<set $eden_wolfbite to 1>>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"W-Wolves... like to show affection th-this way, so..." You rest your head on <<his>> shoulder, tail wagging.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Mmm—" You drag it out, savouring how rare it is to see <<him>> this thrown. "It's just how wolves show they like someone," you say, tail wagging.
<<else>>
	"Wolves show affection this way, so I..." You lean in and press your cheek to <<his>>, tail wagging.
<</if>>
<br><br>
You feel the tension go out of <<him>>. "...I see." <<He>> rests a hand on your head.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<arousal 200>><<glove>><<garousal>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Cabin Eden Actions]]>><<unset $eden_tf_choice>><</link>>


:: Eden Bite Silent
<<effects>>
You don't explain. You straighten up and walk off, leaving <<him>> confused behind you. You catch <<him>> muttering something under <<his>> breath.
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Cabin Eden Actions]]>><<unset $eden_tf_choice>><</link>>


:: Eden Milk
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">>
<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6>><<transform cow 1>><</if>>
<<milkvolume 5>><<outfitChecks>>
<<if _top>>
	You strip off <<allTopsUnderwear>> and bare your <span class="pink"><<breasts>></span> in front of Eden.<<overupperstrip>><<upperstrip>><<underupperstrip>>
<<else>>
	You bare your <span class="pink"><<breasts>></span> in front of Eden.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"Eden... please, milk me," you ask, lowering your head, cheeks warm.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"You're not busy, are you? Come here and help me." You pull <<his>> hand to your chest.
<<else>>
	"Eden, please milk me," you ask. Your cheeks feel warm despite yourself.
<</if>>
<<if Transformations.partActive("cow", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("fox", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("cat", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("wolf", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("bunny", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("bear", "tail") or Transformations.partActive("waterdragon", "tail")>>
	<br><br>
	Your tail brushes against <<him>> as you speak.<<npcincr Eden lust 2>><<glust>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Eden's eyes settle on you the way a predator sizes up something that has wandered too far into its territory.<<npcincr Eden love 1>><<npcincr Eden lust 5>><<glove>><<glust>> <<He>> pulls you into <<his>> arms.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Eden Milk 2]]>><</link>>


:: Eden Milk 2
<<effects>><<pass 30>>
Eden fetches a pair of bowls and sets to work, rolling <<his>> calloused fingers over your <span class="pink">sensitive buds</span>. <<His>> hands are practised.
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Eden.dom lte 50>>
	<<His>> touch stays almost gentle.
<<elseif C.npc.Eden.dom gt 100>>
	<<His>> grip is firm, firm enough to ache.<<pain 1>><<gpain>>
<<else>>
	<<His>> grip is firm, but you can bear it.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<span class="pink">Warmth builds where <<he>> works, spreading through you.</span> You let your eyes fall shut.<<arousal 10000 "breasts">>
<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>><<orgasm>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $lactating is 1>>
	You shudder hard, milk spilling from your nipples into the bowls.
	<br><br>
	<span class="pink">Your legs go weak.</span> If you weren't leaning into <<him>>, you'd have buckled. <<He>> works you through it, then leans in and presses a kiss to your damp neck, breathing you in.<<npcincr Eden lust 8>><<gglust>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $eden_breast_milk to ($milk_amount / 2)>>
	<<milk_amount `-$eden_breast_milk`>>
	<<set $milk_produced_stat += Math.trunc($eden_breast_milk)>>
	<<if $eden_breast_milk gte 3000>>
		<span class="green">The bowls are nearly overflowing with milk.</span>
	<<elseif $eden_breast_milk gte 2000>>
		<span class="teal">The bowls are over half full.</span>
	<<elseif $eden_breast_milk gte 1000>>
		<span class="lblue">There's a good volume of milk in the bowl.</span>
	<<elseif $eden_breast_milk gte 300>>
		<span class="blue">There's a decent amount of milk in the bowl.</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="purple">There's only a dribble in the bowl.</span>
	<</if>>
	<<if $eden_breast_milk gte 2000>>
		<<wearProp "bottle of breast milk">>
		<<set $eden_breast_milk to Math.trunc($eden_breast_milk / 1000)>>
		<span class="gold">You filled <<print $eden_breast_milk>> bottles of breast milk.</span>
		<<tending_give bottle_of_breast_milk $eden_breast_milk>>
	<<elseif $eden_breast_milk gte 1000>>
		<<wearProp "bottle of breast milk">>
		<<set $eden_breast_milk to Math.trunc($eden_breast_milk / 1000)>>
		<span class="gold">You filled a bottle with breast milk.</span>
		<<tending_give bottle_of_breast_milk $eden_breast_milk>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">It isn't enough to fill a bottle. You leave the rest with Eden.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	"Beats doing it yourself." <<He>> gives your backside a light slap.<<arousal 1>><<garousal>> You're still trembling from the high.
<<else>>
	<<He>> works your nipples a while longer, but your <span class="pink"><<breasts>></span> stay dry.
	<br><br>
	"You're tired." <<He>> rubs your back.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Eden Cabin]]>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><<unset $eden_breast_milk>><</link>>
